      "content": "it's hard to even care about talking to a professional when the \"me\" that would talk to them doesn't seem to exist anymore. if i'm just a hollow space, what's there to fix? it feels more like i'm just waiting for the rest of me to fade away completely. like everything is just dissolving into nothingness.",
